  - elementId: slide-44-node-964-Text-12
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 504
      - 144
      - 410.4
      - 349.2
    content:
      fontFamily: Consolas
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#7C3AED'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: '<p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas;font-weight:700">sliding_window_inference</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  ① 标准化 patch_size = (Ph, Pw); ② 根据 overlap 计算 stride</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  ③ 只在右/下侧 padding, 使图落入滑窗网格</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  ④ 生成所有 patch 起点, 每个 patch 独立 forward</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  ⑤ 对 r / b / g / s / r_direct 用 Tukey 二维窗加权累加</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  ⑥ 除以 weight_sum → 裁回原尺寸</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:5px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Consolas;font-weight:700">_tta_forward (可选)</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  4 种变换: 原图 / 水平翻 / 垂直翻 / 双向翻</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  每次输出翻转回原方向后, 对 b / r_direct / g / s 取平均</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  重算 r_sub = clamp(x - avg_b); r_fused = α·avg_r_direct + (1-α)·r_sub</span></p><p><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  最终 r = clamp(r_fused + 0.15·refinement_head(...))</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:5px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#7C3AED;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">保存输出 (单图)</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:10.5px;font-family:Calibri">  *_diffuse.png · *_specular.png · *_gradient.png · *_spec_likelihood.png · *_visualization.png + 可选 16-bit 版本</span></p>'
    sourceLayout: a581b7dfe967625fa883ece7ea05c5eb2e8c67e93e3cf46fa8813d5cf732f949
